        wordmark carried ~3.9px of dead air on its right. `margin-right:-.14em`
        cancels exactly that, so the right gap optically matches the left.

     One wordmark treatment — always caps, always .14em — across all three
     containers. Tracking is mandatory at these sizes: Rubik's caps are tight,
